ke events du vil tilf\u00f8je f\u00f8r 3. juni 2016.\r\nRedigering registrering: fjerne events: Skriv en mail med hvilke events du vil fjernes fra f\u00f8r 3. juni 2016.\r\nRegistreringer uden betalinger: De registreringer uden betaling, vil blive slettet efter tilmeldingsfristen. (3. juni 2016.)\r\nAcceptering af registreringer: Vi betragter en registrering for gyldig, n\u00e5r registreringen er f\u00e6rdig, og tilmeldingsgebyret er betalt. Vi vil f\u00f8rst acceptere tilmeldingen efter begge disse betingelser er opfyldt.\r\nOvernatning\r\nPlads til 70 personer til overnatning p\u00e5 venue.\r\nDet er f\u00f8rst til m\u00f8lle princippet, og det er gratis.\r\nKontakt Camilla (fam.nielsson@gmail.com )\r\nIndkvartering kan fra fredag aften.\r\nMan kan overnatte fra fredag til s\u00f8ndag.\r\n","externalWebsite":"http:\/\/competition.odderen.dk\/DanishOpen2016\/"},{"id":"TaiyuanOpen2016","name":"Taiyuan Open 2016","city":"Taiyuan, Shanxi","country":"CN","date":{"from":"2016-06-05","till":"2016-06-05","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","clock","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Donglei Li (\u674e\u51ac\u96f7)","email":"dli@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Hongda Li (\u674e\u6d2a\u8fbe)","email":"294958832@qq.com"},{"name":"Jiexing Zhang (\u5f20\u6770\u661f)","email":"wrt+2013zhan39@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"Shanxi Traffic Vocational And Technical College","address":"Lecture hall","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":37.759004,"longitude":112.66837}},"information":"","externalWebsite":"http:\/\/cubingchina.com\/competition\/Taiyuan-Open-2016"},{"id":"FuzhouOpen2016","name":"Fuzhou Open 2016","city":"Fuzhou, Fujian","country":"CN","date":{"from":"2016-06-05","till":"2016-06-05","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Ming Zheng (\u90d1\u9e23)","email":"mzheng@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[